4. Kept the necessary providers but with simplified configurations
5. Removed dependencies on next/font and other Next.js specific features
6. Maintained the basic HTML structure and styling classes

This simplified version should work in the preview environment without trying to access server-side features or complex Next.js functionality. The main layout structure is preserved, but without the features that would cause problems in a client-side only preview environment.

